flowchart TD
    A[Proposed claim] --> B[Find supporting passage]
    B --> C{Direct support?}
    C -->|No| D[Mark unsupported or revise claim]
    C -->|Yes| E[Record source and location]
    E --> F[Check identity scope and currency]
    F --> G{Conflict present?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Record conflict and qualify claim]
    G -->|No| I[Include traceable claim]
    H --> I

